    "sections": {
        "description": "<p><strong>ZIOR SimpliBlocks</strong> is a lightweight WordPress plugin that provides essential blocks like an <strong>Icon Picker</strong>, <strong>Icon List</strong>, and <strong>Dynamic Meta Field (Custom Fields)</strong> for the block editor.</p>\n<p>Designed for performance and simplicity, this plugin helps you build clean layouts using <strong>icon blocks</strong> and <strong>meta field blocks</strong> without unnecessary bloat.</p>\n<p>Whether you need an <strong>icon picker for WordPress</strong>, a <strong>minimal icon list block</strong>, or a way to display <strong>custom meta fields dynamically</strong>, SimpliBlocks gives you full control while keeping your site fast.</p>\n<h3>Core Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Icon Picker Block</strong> – Easily select and display icons in your content  </li>\n<li><strong>Icon List Block</strong> – Create clean and flexible icon lists  </li>\n<li><strong>Dynamic Meta Field Block</strong> – Display post meta and custom fields dynamically  </li>\n<li>Lightweight and fast-loading  </li>\n<li>No unnecessary scripts or styles  </li>\n<li>Works with any WordPress theme  </li>\n<li>WooCommerce-ready blocks for product layouts  </li>\n</ul>\n<p>Perfect for developers, designers, and content creators who want <strong>minimalist WordPress blocks</strong> with powerful functionality.</p>\n<h3>WordPress Blocks</h3>\n<h4>Icon Picker (WordPress Icon Picker Block)</h4>\n<p>A simple <strong>icon picker block</strong> that allows you to choose and display icons without heavy dependencies. Ideal for UI elements, features, and visual highlights.</p>\n<h4>Icon List (Minimal Icon List Block)</h4>\n<p>Create responsive and customizable <strong>icon lists</strong> for features, services, and content sections. Designed to be lightweight and flexible.</p>\n<h4>Dynamic Meta Field (Custom Fields Block)</h4>\n<p>Display <strong>meta fields</strong> or <strong>custom fields</strong> dynamically inside the block editor. Perfect for dynamic content, custom post types, and data-driven layouts.</p>\n<h4>WooCommerce Product Price</h4>\n<p>Display product prices dynamically using WooCommerce logic.</p>\n<h4>WooCommerce Product Rating</h4>\n<p>Display product ratings with proper markup and accessibility.</p>\n<h4>WooCommerce Product Add To Cart</h4>\n<p>Insert a dynamic Add to Cart button into your layout.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Icon Picker block for easy icon selection</li>\n<li>Icon List block for structured content</li>\n<li>Meta Field block for dynamic data display</li>\n<li>Lightweight and performance-focused</li>\n<li>Modular blocks — use only what you need</li>\n<li>WooCommerce integration support</li>\n<li>Works with any theme</li>\n<li>Developer-friendly and beginner-friendly</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Documentation</h3>\n<p>For full documentation, usage examples, and more, visit:</p>\n<p>https://ziorweb.dev/docs/zior-simpliblocks</p>\n<h3>License</h3>\n<p>This plugin is licensed under the GPLv2 or later.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin files to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/zior-simpliblocks</code> directory, or install via the WordPress Plugins screen.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin.</li>\n<li>Open the block editor and start using the Icon Picker, Icon List, and Meta Field blocks.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"does%20this%20plugin%20include%20an%20icon%20picker%3F\">\nDoes this plugin include an icon picker?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. It includes a lightweight and easy-to-use <strong>icon picker block</strong>.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"can%20i%20create%20icon%20lists%3F\">\nCan I create icon lists?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. The <strong>icon list block</strong> lets you build clean and flexible lists.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"can%20i%20display%20custom%20fields%20or%20meta%20fields%3F\">\nCan I display custom fields or meta fields?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. The <strong>meta field block</strong> allows you to display dynamic post meta and custom field values.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"does%20this%20plugin%20work%20with%20any%20theme%3F\">\nDoes this plugin work with any theme?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. It works with any WordPress theme.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"do%20woocommerce%20blocks%20require%20woocommerce%3F\">\nDo WooCommerce blocks require WooCommerce?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, WooCommerce must be installed and activated.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"is%20this%20plugin%20lightweight%3F\">\nIs this plugin lightweight?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. It is designed to be minimal and fast.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.5</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added WooCommerce Product Price block</li>\n<li>Added WooCommerce Product Rating block</li>\n<li>Added WooCommerce Product Add To Cart block</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Improved meta field, icon list, and product blocks</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added Icon Picker block</li>\n<li>Added Icon List block</li>\n<li>Added Dynamic Meta Field block</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Icon Picker, Icon List, and Meta Field blocks for WordPress. Lightweight, minimalist, and built for performance.",
    "description": "<p><strong>ZIOR SimpliBlocks</strong> is a lightweight WordPress plugin that provides essential blocks like an <strong>Icon Picker</strong>, <strong>Icon List</strong>, and <strong>Dynamic Meta Field (Custom Fields)</strong> for the block editor.</p>\n<p>Designed for performance and simplicity, this plugin helps you build clean layouts using <strong>icon blocks</strong> and <strong>meta field blocks</strong> without unnecessary bloat.</p>\n<p>Whether you need an <strong>icon picker for WordPress</strong>, a <strong>minimal icon list block</strong>, or a way to display <strong>custom meta fields dynamically</strong>, SimpliBlocks gives you full control while keeping your site fast.</p>\n<h3>Core Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Icon Picker Block</strong> – Easily select and display icons in your content  </li>\n<li><strong>Icon List Block</strong> – Create clean and flexible icon lists  </li>\n<li><strong>Dynamic Meta Field Block</strong> – Display post meta and custom fields dynamically  </li>\n<li>Lightweight and fast-loading  </li>\n<li>No unnecessary scripts or styles  </li>\n<li>Works with any WordPress theme  </li>\n<li>WooCommerce-ready blocks for product layouts  </li>\n</ul>\n<p>Perfect for developers, designers, and content creators who want <strong>minimalist WordPress blocks</strong> with powerful functionality.</p>\n<h3>WordPress Blocks</h3>\n<h4>Icon Picker (WordPress Icon Picker Block)</h4>\n<p>A simple <strong>icon picker block</strong> that allows you to choose and display icons without heavy dependencies. Ideal for UI elements, features, and visual highlights.</p>\n<h4>Icon List (Minimal Icon List Block)</h4>\n<p>Create responsive and customizable <strong>icon lists</strong> for features, services, and content sections. Designed to be lightweight and flexible.</p>\n<h4>Dynamic Meta Field (Custom Fields Block)</h4>\n<p>Display <strong>meta fields</strong> or <strong>custom fields</strong> dynamically inside the block editor. Perfect for dynamic content, custom post types, and data-driven layouts.</p>\n<h4>WooCommerce Product Price</h4>\n<p>Display product prices dynamically using WooCommerce logic.</p>\n<h4>WooCommerce Product Rating</h4>\n<p>Display product ratings with proper markup and accessibility.</p>\n<h4>WooCommerce Product Add To Cart</h4>\n<p>Insert a dynamic Add to Cart button into your layout.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Icon Picker block for easy icon selection</li>\n<li>Icon List block for structured content</li>\n<li>Meta Field block for dynamic data display</li>\n<li>Lightweight and performance-focused</li>\n<li>Modular blocks — use only what you need</li>\n<li>WooCommerce integration support</li>\n<li>Works with any theme</li>\n<li>Developer-friendly and beginner-friendly</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Documentation</h3>\n<p>For full documentation, usage examples, and more, visit:</p>\n<p>https://ziorweb.dev/docs/zior-simpliblocks</p>\n<h3>License</h3>\n<p>This plugin is licensed under the GPLv2 or later.</p>\n",
